alert-prone-name = Downed
alert-prone-desc = You are lying on the floor. Click to get up.
alert-prone-held-desc = You are knocked down and cannot get up until it wears off.
alert-pulling-name = Pulling
alert-pulling-desc = You are dragging something along. Click to let go.
alert-pulled-name = Pulled
alert-pulled-desc = Someone is dragging you along. Click to break free.
alert-crit-name = Dying
alert-crit-desc = You are in critical condition. Click to give up.
alert-stunned-name = Stunned
alert-stunned-desc = You cannot move or use your hands until it wears off.
alert-exhausted-name = Exhausted
alert-exhausted-desc = Too winded to stand; you get up when it passes.
alert-suffocating-name = Suffocating
alert-suffocating-desc = There is not enough air here to breathe. Get to a room that holds some, or open a tank.
alert-poisoned-name = Poisoned
alert-poisoned-desc = You are breathing a toxin. Get out of it, or open a tank.
